un, slow end of Easy","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Wed","focus":{"HS":"Tempo"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"Warm-up and cool-down: 10–15 min Easy each.","lv":"HS"},{"t":"3 × 4 min Tempo, 90 sec jog between. Skip if you're carrying a lot of race fatigue.","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Thu","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"30 min Easy + 4 relaxed strides","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Fri","focus":{"HS":"Speed"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"Warm-up and cool-down: 10–15 min Easy each.","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Distance] [Mid] 3 × 150m at Rep pace (fast and relaxed), full recovery","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Hybrid] 2 × 200m at 800 pace + 2 × 100m at Rep pace (relaxed), full recovery","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Sat","focus":{"HS":"Long run"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"45–60 min long run, Easy pace, comfortable","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Sun","focus":{"HS":"Rest"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"Rest","lv":"HS"}]}}]},{"start":"2027-05-17","days":[{"day":"Mon","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"Girls sectional Tue · Boys sectional Thu","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Girls] 20–25 min Easy + 3 strides","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] 30 min Easy + 4 strides","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Tue","focus":{"HS":"Girls sectional"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] IHSAA Sectional","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] 25–30 min Easy","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Wed","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] Rest or 20–25 min recovery run","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] 20–25 min Easy + 3 strides","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Thu","focus":{"HS":"Boys sectional"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] 25–30 min Easy","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] IHSAA Sectional","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Fri","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] 25 min Easy + mobility","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] Rest or 20 min recovery run","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Sat","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"40–50 min Easy, controlled. Sore or raced really hard? Do less.","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Sun","focus":{"HS":"Rest"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"Rest","lv":"HS"}]}}]},{"start":"2027-05-24","days":[{"day":"Mon","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"Girls regional Tue · Boys regional Thu","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Girls] 20–25 min Easy + 3 strides","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] 30 min Easy + 4 strides","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Tue","focus":{"HS":"Girls regional"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] IHSAA Regional","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] 25–30 min Easy","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Wed","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] Rest or 20 min recovery run","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] 20–25 min Easy + 3 strides","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Thu","focus":{"HS":"Boys regional"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] 25–30 min Easy","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] IHSAA Regional","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Fri","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] 25 min Easy","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] Rest or 20 min recovery run","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Sat","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] 40–50 min Easy","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Boys] 35–45 min Easy","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Sun","focus":{"HS":"Rest"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"Rest","lv":"HS"}]}}]},{"start":"2027-05-31","days":[{"day":"Mon","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"State week. Fresh legs: no hard intervals, no strength that makes you sore, no fitness tests.","lv":"HS"},{"t":"State dates to be confirmed. The last 48 hours get tailored to your event order.","lv":"HS"},{"t":"30–35 min Easy + 4 relaxed strides","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Tue","focus":{"HS":"Sharpen"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"Warm-up and cool-down: 10–15 min Easy each.","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Mid] [Hybrid] 2 × 200m at 800 pace, 5 min recovery, then 2 × 80m at Rep pace (relaxed)","lv":"HS"},{"t":"[Distance] 2 × 200m at 1600 pace, 5 min recovery, then 2 × 80m at Rep pace (relaxed)","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Wed","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"20–30 min Easy","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Thu","focus":{"HS":"Easy"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"15–25 min Easy + 3 short relaxed strides (adjust for travel)","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Fri","focus":{"HS":"Girls state (TBC)"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Girls] State championship (confirm official date)","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Sat","focus":{"HS":"Boys state (TBC)"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"[Boys] State championship (confirm official date)","lv":"HS"}]}},{"day":"Sun","focus":{"HS":"Rest"},"all":[],"groups":{"Distance":[{"t":"Rest","lv":"HS"}]}}]}]$plan$::jsonb;
  cur jsonb; w jsonb; d jsonb; wk jsonb; days jsonb; dd jsonb; keep jsonb;
  fw int; fd int;
begin
  select value into cur from public.hub_data where key = 'workouts' for update;
  if cur is null or jsonb_typeof(cur) <> 'array' then cur := '[]'::jsonb; end if;

  for w in select * from jsonb_array_elements(plan) loop
    fw := null;
    for i in 0 .. jsonb_array_length(cur) - 1 loop
      if cur -> i ->> 'start' = w ->> 'start' then fw := i; end if;
    end loop;
    if fw is null then cur := cur || jsonb_build_array(w); continue; end if;

    wk := cur -> fw;
    days := coalesce(wk -> 'days', '[]'::jsonb);
    for d in select * from jsonb_array_elements(w -> 'days') loop
      fd := null;
      for j in 0 .. jsonb_array_length(days) - 1 loop
        if days -> j ->> 'day' = d ->> 'day' then fd := j; end if;
      end loop;
      if fd is null then days := days || jsonb_build_array(d); continue; end if;

      dd := days -> fd;
      select coalesce(jsonb_agg(x), '[]'::jsonb) into keep
        from jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(dd -> 'groups' -> 'Distance', '[]'::jsonb)) x
        where coalesce(x ->> 'lv', '') <> 'HS';
      dd := jsonb_set(dd, '{groups}',
              coalesce(dd -> 'groups', '{}'::jsonb) || jsonb_build_object('Distance', keep || (d -> 'groups' -> 'Distance')));
      if dd -> 'focus' is null or dd ->> 'focus' = '' then
        dd := jsonb_set(dd, '{focus}', d -> 'focus');
      elsif jsonb_typeof(dd -> 'focus') = 'object' and coalesce(dd -> 'focus' ->> 'HS', '') = '' then
        dd := jsonb_set(dd, '{focus,HS}', d -> 'focus' -> 'HS');
      end if;
      if dd -> 'all' is null then dd := dd || '{"all":[]}'::jsonb; end if;
      days := jsonb_set(days, array[fd::text], dd);
    end loop;

    select jsonb_agg(x order by array_position(array['Mon','Tue','Wed','Thu','Fri','Sat','Sun'], x ->> 'day'))
      into days from jsonb_array_elements(days) x;
    cur := jsonb_set(cur, array[fw::text], jsonb_set(wk, '{days}', days));
  end loop;

  insert into public.hub_data (key, value, updated_at) values ('workouts', cur, now())
  on conflict (key) do update set value = excluded.value, updated_at = now();
  raise notice 'Done: % weeks posted in total', jsonb_array_length(cur);
end
$do$;
